<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [1199].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>1199&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MINERAL MEDIUM (BRUNNER) SUPPLEMENTED WITH TOLUENE</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> (NH<sub>4</sub>)<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>                                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.50&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.20&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
